\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qaYiT98knwQ7kNvwFjc0Lh&_nc_oc=Adl2ybwm9eTY_3IQGVs5uVE8gXhl1c83cbWU-LpRkbugoNKiGWRSBkY5u5Xv6k7SW4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxUQ4_rWQC00iU-nfghK-K26OBwgc6v9t3O6KnAMt6RRQ&oe=69AD5BF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fF6Pev5WKfIQ7kNvwHhqh5p&_nc_oc=Adny4ZxcgLXnpm7CNgJN0ysYzp_SQDniZ-_JWFggMCJdUq1cDtmqxXoXCBRhUOdJ9Ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyhcUSjCc3tGNo8irFMniA3Bfi4Db_f_sygvm4q7Ublhg&oe=69AD5D56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VzJxD88NTAgQ7kNvwEQwZ0p&_nc_oc=Adkg55sA2iCPt3otBH_G__r4ZxWbuFE6SqQk7zzJp4ZDu6ST5lf6tGXYfhO92FhINl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwA7siCoG68neBKiDJulYHgdw-R85todTG4ycN_Ob-HrQ&oe=69AD7277"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771